OL,3,GNEWSASlow-worms could stay put under
OL,4,Anew homes plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for eight homes in Biggin Hill
OL,7,Fhave been submitted for a third time,
OL,8,Fafter an earlier scheme stalled over
OL,9,Fhow a colony of slow-worms would be
OL,10,Fprotected.
OL,12,FThe new owner of 51 and 53 The Grove,
OL,13,Fin the London Borough of Bromley, wants
OL,14,Fto keep the protected legless lizards
OL,15,Fon the site rather than move them 21
OL,16,Fmiles (34km) away to Kent.
OL,18,FA survey he commissioned recorded fewer
OL,19,Fof the reptiles than a previous
OL,20,Fassessment had found.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
