OL,3,GNEWSASlow-worms could stay put under
OL,4,Anew homes plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe application seeks to demolish two
OL,7,Fempty bungalows and replace them with
OL,8,Feight three-storey, four-bedroom
OL,9,Fhouses, each with a back garden and two
OL,10,Fparking spaces.
